    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Elimination makes sure the hazard no longer exists. Most effective method"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Elimination"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#EngineeringControl",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
    "@value" : "2024-05-15"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator" : [ {
    "@value" : "Nick McDonald"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Engineering controls reduce exposure by preventing hazards from coming into contact with workers. They still allow workers to do their jobs, though."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Engineering Control"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#NioshControl"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Engineering controls reduce exposure by preventing hazards from coming into contact with workers. They still allow workers to do their jobs, though."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Engineering Control"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#NioshControl",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor" : [ {
    "@value" : "Nick McDonald"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
    "@value" : "2024-05-08"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Controls are measures that maintain and/or modify risk. In the NIOSH hierarchy, a control is a measure that is in place, is working effectively and operating to reduce either the likelihood or impact of a risk."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "NIOSH Control"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#Control"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Controls are measures that maintain and/or modify risk. In the NIOSH hierarchy, a control is a measure that is in place, is working effectively and operating to reduce either the likelihood or impact of a risk."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "NIOSH Control"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
    "@value" : "2024-05-15"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator" : [ {
    "@value" : "Nick McDonald"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Personal protective equipment (PPE) includes clothing and devices to protect workers. PPE needs constant effort and attention (including proper use and training) from workers. Higher-level controls aren’t always feasible, and PPE might be needed in conjunction with other control measures. Least effective contols."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Personal protective equipment"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#NioshControl"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Personal protective equipment (PPE) includes clothing and devices to protect workers. PPE needs constant effort and attention (including proper use and training) from workers. Higher-level controls aren’t always feasible, and PPE might be needed in conjunction with other control measures. Least effective contols."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Personal protective equipment"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#Subsitution",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created" : [ {
    "@type" : "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
    "@value" : "2024-05-15"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator" : [ {
    "@value" : "Nick McDonald"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Substitution means changing out a material or process to reduce the hazard."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Substitution"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/nioshControlOntology#NioshControl"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Substitution means changing out a material or process to reduce the hazard."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Substitution"
  } ]
